        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 127101,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Terkadang fungsi membutuhkan informasi tertentu untuk membantunya menjalankan tugas. Misalnya, fungsi yang menambahkan nama pemain ke sebuah tim.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #F0F8FF&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   #playerList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Add Team Players&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;Signup&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;playerInput&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;pInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot;&#xA;     placeholder=&quot;Enter a player name&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Submit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Current Team&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=playerList&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   var number = 0;&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    if (number &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Team Full&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     var player = document.getElementById(&quot;pInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     var node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     var textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Added: &quot; + player);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;playerList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     number++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Variables in functions",
            "id": 127102,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebagai permulaan, kita bisa menggunakan konstanta di dalam fungsi. Misalnya membuat <code> let name = \"Ron\"</code> dan menggunakannya dalam pernyataan print.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetRon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetRon()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"35\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let</code>, diikuti oleh <code>name</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>\"Ron\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Similar code",
            "id": 127103,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara kita menyapa orang lain di Swift? Kita bisa membuat dan memanggil fungsi baru <code>greetLeslie()</code> dengan kode yang serupa.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetRon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ron&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetRon()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greetLeslie\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greetLeslie()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"157\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Ron\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>greetLeslie()</code>, diikuti oleh <code>greetLeslie()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing",
            "id": 127104,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Daripada menulis dua fungsi, kita bisa meneruskan informasi tertentu ke satu fungsi saja, tanpa mengulang kode. Berikut sekilas contohnya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;April&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Leslie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, April\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello, Leslie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>Leslie</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Name",
            "id": 127105,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk meneruskan nilai ke fungsi, pertama-tama tambahkan <strong>parameter</strong> di dalam tanda kurung. Di sini, kita akan meneruskan <code>name</code> dan tipenya, yaitu <code>String</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greet\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"func\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>name: String</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "No value",
            "id": 127106,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parameter berfungsi seperti variabel yang menyimpan sebuah nilai. Namun, parameter tersebut belum memiliki nilai.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, \\(name)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"48\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>name: String</code>, diikuti oleh <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Passing a value",
            "id": 127107,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk memberikan nilai ke parameter, kita menempatkannya di antara tanda kurung saat memanggil fungsi, seperti pada <code>greet(name: \"Anna\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Anna\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>greet</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>name:</code>, <code>\"Anna\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
