          {
            "title": "Example: Variables in functions",
            "id": 127114,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat konstanta untuk digunakan di dalam fungsi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"lampStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" power = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Powered On: \\(power)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"lampStatus()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Powered On: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let</code>, diikuti oleh <code>power</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Similar code",
            "id": 127115,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi pernyataan display.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" active = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inactive = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Inactive&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bob: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + inactive)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"userStatus()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bob: Inactive\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print</code>, diikuti oleh <code>inactive</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Pass parameters",
            "id": 127116,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan parameter <code>status</code> ke fungsi tersebut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"userStatus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(status: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bob: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + status)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"userStatus(status: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"30\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bob: Active\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>status: String</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Name",
            "id": 127117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan nama fungsi <code>displayHalf</code> dan parameter <code>number</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayHalf\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" half = number / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(half)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayHalf(number: \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>displayHalf</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>number</code>, <code>: Int)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No value",
            "id": 127118,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil fungsi <code>doubleNumber()</code> dan teruskan nilai <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"doubleNumber\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(number: Int)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = number * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(result)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"doubleNumber(number: \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"95\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>doubleNumber</code>, diikuti oleh <code>number:</code>, dan terakhir <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
